# Phase 1: Project Planning Phase

## Project Title: EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

### 1. Introduction

The Project Planning Phase is the first stage of the EduGenie project. It focuses on identifying the project objectives, scope, target users, required resources, timeline, and development strategy.

EduGenie is a web-based AI-powered educational platform designed to help students understand academic topics, clarify doubts, generate study notes, summarize learning materials, and prepare for examinations using Google Gemini AI.

### 2. Project Objectives

1. To develop an AI-powered virtual learning assistant.

2. To provide instant answers to students' academic questions.

3. To generate simplified notes for different subjects.

4. To summarize lengthy educational materials.

5. To support students in examination preparation.

6. To create a user-friendly and interactive learning platform.

7. To integrate Google Gemini API for intelligent responses.

### 3. Project Scope

The project focuses on developing a web application that provides:

* AI-powered chatbot.

* Automatic notes generation.

* Study material summarization.

* Topic explanations with examples.

* Exam-oriented questions and answers.

* Interactive student interface.

### 4. Target Users

* College students

* School students

* Teachers

* Self-learners

* Competitive examination aspirants

